MACRO 1 PREF WORK '*'                                                           
* *                                                                             
* *    W W I D F T G                                                            
* *                                                                             
* *       TEST AV                                                               
* *       - FÖRETAGSKOD                                                         
* *                                                                             
* *    U S A G E :                                                              
* *                                                                             
* *        THIS COPYTEXT IS A DUAL-PURPOSE COPYTEXT. IF COULD BE USED           
* *    JUST TO DEFINE IDFTG CONSTANTS, AND/OR COULD BE USED AS A                
* *    PROCEDURE TO CHECK IDFTG VALUES.                                         
* *        IF THIS COPYTEXT IS NEEDED IN EPLUST PROGRAM, THEN THERE             
* *    MUST BE ATLEAST ONE DEFINITION IN THE WORKING STORAGE  AREA,             
* *    LIKE THIS...                                                             
* *              %WWIDFTG  REQUIRED-PREFIX  WORK ''                             
* *                                                                             
* *                                                                             
* *  IDFTG CONSTANT DEFINITIONS.                                                
* *                                                                             
&WORK DEFINE WC-IDFTG-US                W 2 N VALUE 53                          
&WORK DEFINE WC-IDFTG-CA                W 2 N VALUE 54                          
&WORK DEFINE WC-IDFTG-PV                W 2 N VALUE 57                          
&WORK DEFINE WC-IDFTG-CN                W 2 N VALUE 60                          
&WORK DEFINE WC-IDFTG-IN                W 2 N VALUE 61                          
&WORK DEFINE WC-IDFTG-TH                W 2 N VALUE 63                          
&WORK DEFINE WC-IDFTG-TW                W 2 N VALUE 64                          
&WORK DEFINE WC-IDFTG-KR                W 2 N VALUE 65                          
&WORK DEFINE WC-IDFTG-MY                W 2 N VALUE 66                          
&WORK DEFINE WC-IDFTG-RU                W 2 N VALUE 81                          
&WORK DEFINE WC-IDFTG-BR                W 2 N VALUE 82                          
&WORK DEFINE WC-IDFTG-MX                W 2 N VALUE 83                          
&WORK DEFINE WC-IDFTG-ZA                W 2 N VALUE 85                          
&WORK DEFINE WC-IDFTG-TR                W 2 N VALUE 86                          
&WORK DEFINE WC-IDFTG-AE                W 2 N VALUE 87                          
MEND                                                                            
